  "details": "Description\n\nWhenever I open the menu using finger tracking I can only use my left hand to interact with it. The right hand does not have a laser pointer until I open the larger menu screen. This only started today.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nUse finger tracking and touch the thumb to index finger on the left hand to open the menu. The right hand can not interact with the menu.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-03_00-43-36.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_2d9b7cbe-03fb-4ffc-be48-fb5542f038c9/1/file)",
